# Cursor already skips .env* and everything in .gitignore. These lines say so out loud, and
# put back what AGENTS.md tells an agent to read.

# Secrets. The tunnel token lives in .env.live now, with the rest of live's settings.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Real resumes, screenshots, cover letters and backups
data/
data-live/

# The PRD, build plan and design doc are gitignored but meant to be read (AGENTS.md).
!docs/
